  "about": "Time Check's named zones: the display name Windows and Veeam's logs print, the standard and daylight names, the IANA name, and the offsets and daylight saving rules year by year. A rule's from and to are years; a year before the first rule uses the first, a year after the last uses the last. A transition is a month with a week (5: the last) and weekday (0: Sunday), or a fixed day, at a local time: the start in standard time, the end in daylight time. Generated by tools/dev/Generate-TimeZones.ps1.",
